{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"a842ba38-2115-49ba-9a5b-5d59195a1bae","step":{"id":"s1","script":"A butterfly can model mirror symmetry. The dashed vertical line divides this shape into matching left and right halves.","ops":[{"op":"text","id":"title","region":"A1","content":"Mirror symmetry"},{"op":"diagram","id":"butterfly","region":"right","primitives":[{"kind":"line","points":[[0.5,0.08],[0.5,0.92]],"stroke":"dashed","label":"mirror line"},{"kind":"smooth","points":[[0.49,0.43],[0.25,0.18],[0.12,0.28],[0.2,0.49],[0.49,0.55]],"stroke":"solid","meaning":"left upper wing"},{"kind":"smooth","points":[[0.51,0.43],[0.75,0.18],[0.88,0.28],[0.8,0.49],[0.51,0.55]],"stroke":"solid","meaning":"right upper wing"},{"kind":"smooth","points":[[0.49,0.55],[0.23,0.57],[0.22,0.77],[0.37,0.8],[0.49,0.65]],"stroke":"solid","meaning":"left lower wing"},{"kind":"smooth","points":[[0.51,0.55],[0.77,0.57],[0.78,0.77],[0.63,0.8],[0.51,0.65]],"stroke":"solid","meaning":"right lower wing"},{"kind":"ellipse","center":[0.5,0.53],"radius":[0.025,0.2],"stroke":"solid","meaning":"butterfly body centered on the mirror line"}]}],"checkpoint":null}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"a842ba38-2115-49ba-9a5b-5d59195a1bae","step":{"id":"s2","script":"Choose a point on the left wing. Its mirror partner lies at the same height on the right wing.","ops":[{"op":"point","id":"leftpoint","canvas_id":"butterfly","at":[0.25,0.18],"label":"P"},{"op":"point","id":"rightpoint","canvas_id":"butterfly","at":[0.75,0.18],"label":"P′"},{"op":"line","id":"pairline","canvas_id":"butterfly","from":[0.25,0.18],"to":[0.75,0.18],"stroke":"dashed","meaning":"corresponding points joined perpendicular to the mirror line"}],"checkpoint":{"question":"If P moves farther left, where must its mirror partner move?","expected_gist":"Farther right by the same amount, staying at the same height."}}}
{"type":"lesson.step","request_id":"a842ba38-2115-49ba-9a5b-5d59195a1bae","step":{"id":"s3","script":"The mirror line cuts the joining segment in half at a right angle. To draw symmetric wings, copy each point equally far across.","ops":[{"op":"point","id":"midpoint","construct":{"kind":"along","element_id":"pairline","t":0.5},"label":"M"},{"op":"equation","id":"equalparts","anchor":{"el":"title","side":"below","gap":0.08},"latex":"PM=MP'"},{"op":"text","id":"drawingrule","anchor":{"el":"equalparts","side":"below","gap":0.08},"content":"Same height; equal distance across."}],"checkpoint":null}}
